# Ready-made local setup: copy to .env.local and you are running.
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# Addresses match a fresh `anvil` + the deploy script, which are deterministic.
# These are Anvil's well-known development keys. They are public, hold no real value, and must
# never be used on any network that matters.
